# .NET build output — never track compiled artifacts or intermediate object files.
# These are regenerated by `dotnet build` and bloat the repo (159+ tracked files before this).
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Godot C# (.NET) build output — the equivalent of bin/obj for the Godot project.
godot/.godot/mono/

# IDE / editor-local state.
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
.idea/
